                            <div class="sys-line opacity-0 text-cyan-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Loaded: IAM / Access Control</div>
                            <div class="sys-line opacity-0 text-cyan-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Loaded: DNS/DHCP Management</div>
                            <div class="sys-line opacity-0 text-cyan-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Loaded: Disaster Recovery</div>
                            <div class="sys-line opacity-0 text-cyan-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Loaded: VPN & Remote Access</div>
