                            <div class="tool-line opacity-0 text-purple-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Init: Wireshark (Packet Analysis)</div>
                            <div class="tool-line opacity-0 text-purple-400 pl-3 lg:pl-4 2xl:pl-6">[ OK ] Init: Git / GitHub</div>
